# ls-toto — Implementation (C11)

## Module layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `include/ls_toto.h` | `LS_TOTO_VERSION_STRING`, `LS_TOTO_EXIT_*` enum, `ls_toto_run()` declaration |
| `include/ls_toto_cli.h` | `LS_TOTO_ARG_*` flag macros, `struct ls_toto_opts`, `enum ls_toto_parse_status`, `ls_toto_parse_args()`, `print_help()`, `print_version()` |
| `include/ls_toto_emit.h` | `ls_toto_emit_error()`, `ls_toto_emit_cannot_access()`, `ls_toto_emit_cannot_open_dir()`, `ls_toto_emit_invalid_option()`, `ls_toto_emit_unrecognized_option()` |
| `include/ls_toto_fs.h` | platform-neutral `struct ls_toto_entry`, `enum ls_toto_ftype`, `ls_toto_fs_stat()`, `ls_toto_fs_read_dir()`, `ls_toto_entries_free()`, `ls_toto_strdup()` |
